{"parse": {"title": "苦目风味糖球", "pageid": 118685, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"苦目风味糖球\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/14/Item-31.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"苦目风味糖球\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>苦目风味糖球</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>3#31</div></div><hr /><div>由苦目风味制糖机制作的糖球，用玻璃纸包装妥当，略带苦目树的味道。可恢复60点细胞活性。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">\n学界取得了新突破：在573K高温及神秘术的催化下，糖、酒精和过剩的精力能够逆向转化为苦目树液类似物。可惜热力学定律依然具有统治力，下一个热门课题将是制造糖球时如何尽量减小能量损耗。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "苦目风味糖球"}}